.TH n3nctl 1  "29 Oct 2026" "version 3" "SUPERUSER COMMANDS"
.SH NAME
n3nctl \- Query n3n daemons in
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B n3nctl
[\fIoptions..\fR] [command] [\fIcommand args\fR]
.br
.B n3nctl help
.br
.B n3nctl --help
.SH DESCRIPTION
n3n is a peer-to-peer VPN system - it is the LAN you have when you have noLAN.

.B n3nctl
is a command line tool to query the management interface of the n3n daemons.
